 75RB    40CA(40CA,APG)                1997GR07,2007WY01,2010DA1913NDS    201309
 75RB  H TYP=FUL$AUT=ALEXANDRU NEGRET, BALRAJ SINGH$CIT=NDS 114, 841 (2013)$    
 75RB2 H CUT=30-Jun-2013$                                                       
 75RB c  1997Gr07 (also 1997Gr13): E=128 MeV. Measured                          
 75RB2c  E|g, I|g, |g|g|g, recoil-|g, |g|g(|q)(DCO) using EUROGAM array         
 75RB3c  with 45 Ge detectors. TRS calculations                                 
 75RB c  2007Wy01: E=165 MeV. Measured E|g, I|g, |g|g using Gammasphere and     
 75RB2c  Microball arrays. Target=350 |mg/cm{+2} enriched {+40}Ca target flashed
 75RB3c  with 150 |mg/cm{+2} layers of Au on both sides. Rotational structures  
 75RB4c  observed in {+75}Rb compared to those observed in neighboring T{-z}=1/2
 75RB5c  nucleus {+73}Kr. Total Routhian  calculations (TRS) with T=1 pairing   
 75RB6c  for {+75}Rb and T=0 pairing for {+73}Kr.                               
 75RB d  Details of data were requested by the compilers of XUNDL dataset       
 75RB2d  through e-mail to the first author on July 2, 2007, but no response    
 75RB3d  was received as of July 2011                                           
 75RB c  2010Da19: lifetimes were obtained from the same data as reported in    
 75RB2c  2007Wy01. Transition quadrupole moments were deduced from              
 75RB3c  these data. Residual Doppler-shift attenuation method (RDSAM) was used 
 75RB4c  to measure the lifetimes. The level scheme is from 2007Wy01.           
 75RB5c  Configurations and band terminations are discussed                     
 75RB6c  and comparisons made with cranked Nilsson-Strutinsky calculations      
 75RB cG E$ From 1997Gr07 up to 8 MeV excitation with the same values listed    
 75RB2cG in 2007Wy01. Above this energy, most values are from 2007Wy01.         
 75RB3cG Uncertainty given in 1997Gr07 is less than 1 keV for low energy strong 
 75RB4cG |g rays and up to 2 keV for transitions near the top of bands          
 75RB cG M$From |g|g(|q) (DCO) ratios by 1997Gr07. The values are not quoted.   
 75RB cG E(A)$Transition inferred from coincidence data                         
 75RB cG M(E)$Consistent with |DJ=1, dipole from |g|g(|q) (DCO) (1997Gr07)      
 75RB cG M(F)$Consistent with |DJ=2, Q from |g|g(|q) (DCO) (1997Gr07)           
 75RB cL J(Z)$From Adopted Levels                                               
 75RB cL J$From band assignments (1997Gr07,2007Wy01) based also on neighboring  
 75RB2cL odd-A Br and Rb isotopes.                                              
 75RB cL E$From least-squares fit to E|g data, assuming |D(E|g)=1 keV           
 75RB cL E(D)$ Measured Q(transition)=1.90 (2010Da19)                           
 75RB cL E(E)$ Measured Q(transition)=2.35 (2010Da19)                           
 75RB CL BAND(A)$ Band based on 3/2(-),ALPHA=-1/2.                              
 75RB2cL Low-lying members of the band built on |p3/2[312] Nilsson orbital      
 75RB3cL (1997Gr07). Higher members are discussed in 2007Wy01 and 2010Da19      
 75RB4cL in terms of |pp{-3/2} - |pf{-5/2} pseudospin doublet and band          
 75RB5cL termination                                                            
 75RB CL BAND(a)$ Band based on 3/2(-),ALPHA=+1/2.                              
 75RB2cL Lifetimes measured for levels of J|p=9/2- to                           
 75RB3cL 65/2- (2010Da19). Variation in transition quadrupole moment over the   
 75RB4cL whole range=0.37 eb. Band remains collective at maximum spin.          
 75RB5cL See also comment for |a=-1/2 signature for configuration               
 75RB CL BAND(C)$ Band based on (3/2+),ALPHA=+1/2.                              
 75RB2cL Low-lying members of the band built on |p3/2[431] Nilsson orbital      
 75RB3cL (1997Gr07). Higher members are discussed in 2007Wy01 and 2010Da19      
 75RB4cL in terms of |pp{-3/2} - |pf{-5/2} pseudospin doublet and band          
 75RB5cL termination.                                                           
 75RB6cL Lifetimes measured for levels of J|p=13/2+ to 61/2+ (2010Da19).        
 75RB7cL Variation in transition quadrupole moment over the whole range=0.33 eb.
 75RB8cL Band remains collective at maximum spin.                               
 75RB CL BAND(c)$ Band based on (3/2+),ALPHA=-1/2.                              
